{"audio": "john-16.opus", "duration_ms": 260500, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 2100, "end_ms": 3600, "text": "John, Chapter Sixteen."}, {"start_ms": 4960, "end_ms": 7981, "text": "“I have told you these things so that you will not fall away."}, {"start_ms": 8661, "end_ms": 10561, "text": "They will put you out of the synagogues."}, {"start_ms": 10981, "end_ms": 16181, "text": "In fact, a time is coming when anyone who kills you will think he is offering a service to God."}, {"start_ms": 16841, "end_ms": 20522, "text": "They will do these things because they have not known the Father or Me."}, {"start_ms": 21482, "end_ms": 26962, "text": "But I have told you these things so that when their hour comes, you will remember that I told you about them."}, {"start_ms": 27722, "end_ms": 31782, "text": "I did not tell you these things from the beginning, because I was with you."}, {"start_ms": 32823, "end_ms": 43343, "text": "Now, however, I am going to Him who sent Me; yet none of you asks Me, ‘Where are You going?’ Instead, your hearts are filled with sorrow because I have told you these things."}, {"start_ms": 43943, "end_ms": 47904, "text": "But I tell you the truth, it is for your benefit that I am going away."}, {"start_ms": 48504, "end_ms": 54104, "text": "Unless I go away, the Advocate will not come to you; but if I go, I will send Him to you."}, {"start_ms": 55044, "end_ms": 69025, "text": "And when He comes, He will convict the world in regard to sin and righteousness and judgment: in regard to sin, because they do not believe in Me; in regard to righteousness, because I am going to the Father and you will no longer see Me;"}, {"start_ms": 69765, "end_ms": 73946, "text": "and in regard to judgment, because the prince of this world has been condemned."}, {"start_ms": 75086, "end_ms": 78746, "text": "I still have much to tell you, but you cannot yet bear to hear it."}, {"start_ms": 79306, "end_ms": 83326, "text": "However, when the Spirit of truth comes, He will guide you into all truth."}, {"start_ms": 83866, "end_ms": 89987, "text": "For He will not speak on His own, but He will speak what He hears, and He will declare to you what is to come."}, {"start_ms": 90767, "end_ms": 95087, "text": "He will glorify Me by taking from what is Mine and disclosing it to you."}, {"start_ms": 96007, "end_ms": 98728, "text": "Everything that belongs to the Father is Mine."}, {"start_ms": 99288, "end_ms": 103988, "text": "That is why I said that the Spirit will take from what is Mine and disclose it to you."}, {"start_ms": 105048, "end_ms": 117669, "text": "In a little while you will see Me no more, and then after a little while you will see Me.” Then some of His disciples asked one another, “Why is He telling us, ‘In a little while you will not see Me,"}, {"start_ms": 118209, "end_ms": 127550, "text": "and then after a little while you will see Me’ and ‘Because I am going to the Father’?” They kept asking, “Why is He saying, ‘a little while’?"}, {"start_ms": 127910, "end_ms": 142171, "text": "We do not understand what He is saying.” Aware that they wanted to question Him, Jesus said to them, “Are you asking one another why I said, ‘In a little while you will not see Me, and then after a little while you will see Me’?"}, {"start_ms": 142911, "end_ms": 147771, "text": "Truly, truly, I tell you, you will weep and wail while the world rejoices."}, {"start_ms": 148271, "end_ms": 150952, "text": "You will grieve, but your grief will turn to joy."}, {"start_ms": 151812, "end_ms": 162332, "text": "A woman has pain in childbirth because her time has come; but when she brings forth her child, she forgets her anguish because of her joy that a child has been born into the world."}, {"start_ms": 163113, "end_ms": 170553, "text": "So also you have sorrow now, but I will see you again and your hearts will rejoice, and no one will take away your joy."}, {"start_ms": 171793, "end_ms": 174553, "text": "In that day you will no longer ask Me anything."}, {"start_ms": 175253, "end_ms": 180354, "text": "Truly, truly, I tell you, whatever you ask the Father in My name, He will give you."}, {"start_ms": 181254, "end_ms": 184194, "text": "Until now you have not asked for anything in My name."}, {"start_ms": 184794, "end_ms": 188174, "text": "Ask and you will receive, so that your joy may be complete."}, {"start_ms": 189055, "end_ms": 192075, "text": "I have spoken these things to you in figures of speech."}, {"start_ms": 192655, "end_ms": 198335, "text": "An hour is coming when I will no longer speak to you this way, but will tell you plainly about the Father."}, {"start_ms": 199075, "end_ms": 201135, "text": "In that day you will ask in My name."}, {"start_ms": 201896, "end_ms": 204856, "text": "I am not saying that I will ask the Father on your behalf."}, {"start_ms": 205256, "end_ms": 210556, "text": "For the Father Himself loves you, because you have loved Me and have believed that I came from God."}, {"start_ms": 211476, "end_ms": 213796, "text": "I came from the Father and entered the world."}, {"start_ms": 214356, "end_ms": 223757, "text": "In turn, I will leave the world and go to the Father.” His disciples said, “See, now You are speaking plainly and without figures of speech."}, {"start_ms": 224417, "end_ms": 229478, "text": "Now we understand that You know all things and that You have no need for anyone to question You."}, {"start_ms": 230118, "end_ms": 236178, "text": "Because of this, we believe that You came from God.” “Do you finally believe?” Jesus replied."}, {"start_ms": 236738, "end_ms": 244179, "text": "“Look, an hour is coming and has already come when you will be scattered, each to his own home, and you will leave Me all alone."}, {"start_ms": 244959, "end_ms": 247939, "text": "Yet I am not alone, because the Father is with Me."}, {"start_ms": 249019, "end_ms": 252459, "text": "I have told you these things so that in Me you may have peace."}, {"start_ms": 253099, "end_ms": 254920, "text": "In the world you will have tribulation."}, {"start_ms": 255440, "end_ms": 258640, "text": "But take courage; I have overcome the world!”"}], "words": [{"t": "John,", "s": 2100, "e": 2400, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 2640, "e": 2980, "si": 0}, {"t": "Sixteen.", "s": 3060, "e": 3600, "si": 0}, {"t": "“I", "s": 4960, "e": 4980, "si": 1}, {"t": "have", "s": 5020, "e": 5140, "si": 1}, {"t": "told", "s": 5200, "e": 5460, "si": 1}, {"t": "you", "s": 5500, "e": 5580, "si": 1}, {"t": "these", "s": 5640, "e": 5900, "si": 1}, {"t": "things", "s": 5940, "e": 6320, "si": 1}, {"t": "so", "s": 6400, "e": 6480, "si": 1}, {"t": "that", "s": 6561, "e": 6701, "si": 1}, {"t": "you", "s": 6781, "e": 6901, "si": 1}, {"t": "will", "s": 6961, "e": 7121, "si": 1}, {"t": "not", "s": 7201, "e": 7401, "si": 1}, {"t": "fall", "s": 7481, "e": 7661, "si": 1}, {"t": "away.", "s": 7721, "e": 7981, "si": 1}, {"t": "They", "s": 8661, "e": 8781, "si": 2}, {"t": "will", "s": 8821, "e": 8961, "si": 2}, {"t": "put", "s": 9041, "e": 9221, "si": 2}, {"t": "you", "s": 9301, "e": 9401, "si": 2}, {"t": "out", "s": 9481, "e": 9621, "si": 2}, {"t": "of", "s": 9641, "e": 9701, "si": 2}, {"t": "the", "s": 9741, "e": 9821, "si": 2}, {"t": "synagogues.", "s": 9901, "e": 10561, "si": 2}, {"t": "In", "s": 10981, "e": 11061, "si": 3}, {"t": "fact,", "s": 11121, "e": 11381, "si": 3}, {"t": "a", "s": 11441, "e": 11461, "si": 3}, {"t": "time", "s": 11521, "e": 11801, "si": 3}, {"t": "is", "s": 11841, "e": 11921, "si": 3}, {"t": "coming", "s": 12001, "e": 12301, "si": 3}, {"t": "when", "s": 12341, "e": 12501, "si": 3}, {"t": "anyone", "s": 12641, "e": 13041, "si": 3}, {"t": "who", "s": 13061, "e": 13161, "si": 3}, {"t": "kills", "s": 13321, "e": 13661, "si": 3}, {"t": "you", "s": 13701, "e": 13801, "si": 3}, {"t": "will", "s": 13861, "e": 14021, "si": 3}, {"t": "think", "s": 14081, "e": 14301, "si": 3}, {"t": "he", "s": 14341, "e": 14421, "si": 3}, {"t": "is", "s": 14481, "e": 14601, "si": 3}, {"t": "offering", "s": 14721, "e": 15061, "